      "text": "10-Day Motorcycle Tour of Brazil"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:lead:e3456bc1f4d270f4",
      "field": "lead",
      "sourceTextSha256": "1254b5c7c58d01f4c36b87d3ab3d6dc62bec38de7310672c67117410ace7774b",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-worker-mw96kqoe-lg4q4klwz6",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "This motorcycle tour is designed for groups of at least 10 people. Ride from São Paulo through the mountains of Minas Gerais to Capitólio, then via Petrópolis to Rio de Janeiro and along the Costa Verde coast to Paraty. Over 10 days, the itinerary alternates long rides with boat trips and city tours. The longest legs are from São Paulo to Capitólio and from Capitólio to Petrópolis. From Rio, the route follows the coast to Paraty before the final leg brings the group back to São Paulo."
    },
